flowchart TB
    CLI["正式 backup / verify / restore"] --> Owner["原 Product State Owner"]
    Owner --> Tree["原 PrivateStateTree"]
    Tree --> Files["WindowsKeyFiles.open"]
    Files --> Win32["原 CreateFileW 与身份 / 私有ACL"]
    Win32 --> Error["立即捕获原生错误"]
    Win32 -->|成功观察| Inventory["完整布局 / 引用验真"]
    Error --> Missing["仅元数据 2 / 3 类型化缺失"]
    Missing --> Gate["原 SQLite 生命周期谓词"]
    Gate --> Inventory
    Inventory --> Private["私有六库 / Key / Blob / Process事实"]
    Private --> Receipt["原来源回执 / 恢复Journal"]
    Error --> Refuse["权限 / 共享 / 正文读取仍拒绝"]
    Receipt -. "公开只输出摘要" .-> Public["低敏证据，不含状态或凭据"]
